.* Service: WRKCNTINF's menu and the contact information display,
.* WRKSRVPVD and DSPSRVSTS. No pub400 golden: pub400 refuses them; ours
.* are under ui/uim/tests/golden/service.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=SELCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 40'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=LONGCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=SELCL.
:VAR NAME=CNT01 CLASS=LONGCL.
:VAR NAME=CNT02 CLASS=LONGCL.
:VAR NAME=CNT03 CLASS=LONGCL.
:VAR NAME=CNT04 CLASS=LONGCL.
:VAR NAME=CNT05 CLASS=LONGCL.
:VAR NAME=CNT06 CLASS=LONGCL.
:VAR NAME=CNT07 CLASS=LONGCL.
:VAR NAME=CNT08 CLASS=LONGCL.
:VAR NAME=CNT09 CLASS=LONGCL.
:VAR NAME=CNT10 CLASS=LONGCL.
:VAR NAME=CNT11 CLASS=LONGCL.
:VAR NAME=CNT12 CLASS=LONGCL.
:VAR NAME=CNT13 CLASS=LONGCL.
:VAR NAME=CPNAME CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=NETID CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=CNNTYPE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=PVDTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=SRV01 CLASS=LONGCL.
:VAR NAME=SRV02 CLASS=LONGCL.
:VAR NAME=SRV03 CLASS=LONGCL.
:VAR NAME=SRV04 CLASS=LONGCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=PVDS VARS='OPT CPNAME NETID CNNTYPE PVDTEXT'.
:IMPORT NAME=CHGCNTINF PNLGRP=QHSXCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKPRB PNLGRP=QHSXCMD.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/MNKEYS' NAME=MNKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/LSKEYS' NAME=LSKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKCNTINF KEYL=MNKEYS HELP=WRKCNTINF ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with Support Contact Information
:MENU DEPTH='*' OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI HELP=CHGCNTINF OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD ?CHGCNTINF'.Change service contact information
:MENUI HELP='WRKCNTINF/OPT2' OPTION=2 ACTION='RETURN 102'.Display service contact information
:MENUI HELP='WRKCNTINF/OPT3' OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD WRKSRVPVD'.Work with service providers
:MENUI HELP=WRKPRB OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD WRKPRB'.Work with problems
:EMENU.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPCNTINF KEYL=MNKEYS HELP=DSPCNTINF ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Service Contact Information
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CNT01' VAR=CNT01 USAGE=OUTPUT.Company
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CNT02' VAR=CNT02 USAGE=OUTPUT.Contact
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CNT03' VAR=CNT03 USAGE=OUTPUT.Primary telephone
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CNT04' VAR=CNT04 USAGE=OUTPUT.Alternative telephone
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CNT05' VAR=CNT05 USAGE=OUTPUT.Primary fax
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CNT06' VAR=CNT06 USAGE=OUTPUT.Alternative fax
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CNT07' VAR=CNT07 USAGE=OUTPUT.Street address
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CNT08' VAR=CNT08 USAGE=OUTPUT.City/State
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CNT09' VAR=CNT09 USAGE=OUTPUT.Country or region
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CNT10' VAR=CNT10 USAGE=OUTPUT.Postal code
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CNT11' VAR=CNT11 USAGE=OUTPUT.National language version
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CNT12' VAR=CNT12 USAGE=OUTPUT.Media for mailing fixes
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CNT13' VAR=CNT13 USAGE=OUTPUT.E-mail address
:EDATA.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKSRVPVD KEYL=LSKEYS HELP=WRKSRVPVD ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with Service Providers
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=PVDS.(No service providers)
:LISTACT HELP='WRKSRVPVD/OPTIONS' OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 5'.5=Display
:LISTACT HELP='WRKSRVPVD/OPTIONS' OPTION=9 ENTER='RETURN 9'.9=Send test request
:LISTCOL HELP='WRKSRVPVD/OPT' VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/CPNAME' VAR=CPNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.Control Point
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/NETID' VAR=NETID USAGE=OUTPUT.Network ID
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/CNNTYPE' VAR=CNNTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Connection
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/PVDTEXT' VAR=PVDTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Description
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPSRVSTS KEYL=MNKEYS HELP=DSPSRVSTS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Service Status
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SRV01' VAR=SRV01 USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SRV02' VAR=SRV02 USAGE=OUTPUT.Serviced by job
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SRV03' VAR=SRV03 USAGE=OUTPUT.Trace active
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SRV04' VAR=SRV04 USAGE=OUTPUT.Trace sessions
:EDATA.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKCNTINF.Work with Support Contact Information - Help
:P.Who the service provider calls back and where fixes are mailed, and
the providers this system reports problems to.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPCNTINF.Display Service Contact Information - Help
:P.What CHGCNTINF last recorded. Blank lines were never given.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=WRKSRVPVD.Work with Service Providers - Help
:P.The providers problem reports go to. A connection of *NONE means none
is configured: reports are prepared and kept.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPSRVSTS.Display Service Status - Help
:P.Whether a job is being serviced from another job and which traces
collect its events.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MNKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKCNTINF/OPT2'.Display service contact information
:P.Option 2. Display service contact information.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKCNTINF/OPT3'.Work with service providers
:P.Option 3. Runs the WRKSRVPVD command&colon. Work with service
providers.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CNT01'.Company
:P.The company shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CNT02'.Contact
:P.The contact shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CNT03'.Primary telephone
:P.The primary telephone shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CNT04'.Alternative telephone
:P.The alternative telephone shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CNT05'.Primary fax
:P.The primary fax shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CNT06'.Alternative fax
:P.The alternative fax shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CNT07'.Street address
:P.The street address shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CNT08'.City/State
:P.The city/State shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CNT09'.Country or region
:P.The country or region shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CNT10'.Postal code
:P.The postal code shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CNT11'.National language version
:P.The national language version shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CNT12'.Media for mailing fixes
:P.The media for mailing fixes shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CNT13'.E-mail address
:P.The e-mail address shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/LSKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F5=Refresh
:PD.Shows the display again with the current information.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKSRVPVD/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CPNAME'.Control Point
:P.The control Point of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/NETID'.Network ID
:P.The network ID of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CNNTYPE'.Connection
:P.The connection of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PVDTEXT'.Description
:P.The description of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKSRVPVD/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.5=Display
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to display it.
:PT.9=Send test request
:PD.Type 9 next to an entry and press Enter to send test request it.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SRV01'.Job
:P.The job, by name, user and number. A job name alone is enough when
only one job has it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SRV02'.Serviced by job
:P.The serviced by job shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SRV03'.Trace active
:P.The trace active shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SRV04'.Trace sessions
:P.The trace sessions shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
